{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14211330","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14211330","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1421133001:1":{"text":"소년 시절부터 남달랐고, 청년 시절엔 돋보였으니... 이제 전설은 충분하지 않아?","source_cn":"少年时期的与众不同，青年时期的脱颖而出，作为传奇已经够了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6CB4F06EF1564B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421133002:1":{"text":"그럴 수는 없어! 벌써 다음 장면도 다 구상해 놨는걸.","source_cn":"那怎么行！我都想好了下面一段——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9333299F0C585122","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421133003:1":{"text":"인듀어 님께서 근위대에서 입지를 굳히고 활약하던 때의 이야기야!","source_cn":"因度厄大人在卫队中站稳脚跟后，大展拳脚的故事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2FAF01E4DB2999F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421133004:1":{"text":"그, 그건 나한테 물어봐도 잘 몰라. 동료이긴 하지만 평소에는 각자 맡은 일만 하니까.","source_cn":"这个，你问我我也不算特别清楚，我们毕竟是同僚，平时也是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBB5FD1B3470C081","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421133005:1":{"text":"그런 건 결국 사리에 님이나 알고 있을걸... 혹시 사리에 님을 만나게 해달라고 하려고?","source_cn":"你这些要说的话也只有沙利叶大人才知……你就是想让我带你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FEFDF263657329F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421133006:1":{"text":"시레이, 제발! 난 사리에 님을 어떻게 찾아야 할지도 모르겠고, 분명 날 거들떠도 안 보실 거야. 그러니까 한 번만 만날 수 있게 해줘!","source_cn":"拜托了，拜托了席蕾！我根本找不到沙利叶大人，他也不一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC92E89A5EF04A879","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421133007:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님께도 부탁드려요. 사리에 님이랑 친하시죠?","source_cn":"还有<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDC03CC06420C08BD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님께도 부탁드려요. 사리에 님이랑 친하시죠?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님께도 부탁드려요. 사리에 님이랑 친하시죠?","variant_male_record_index":"164443","variant_female_record_index":"164444","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1421133007":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님께도 부탁드려요. 사리에 님이랑 친하시죠?","source_cn":"还有<style=stress><player_name></style>大人，拜托了拜托了，我最爱你了！你也跟沙利叶大人很熟吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDC03CC06420C08BD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님께도 부탁드려요. 사리에 님이랑 친하시죠?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님께도 부탁드려요. 사리에 님이랑 친하시죠?","variant_male_record_index":"164443","variant_female_record_index":"164444","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421133008:1":{"text":"야호! 정말 감사해요. 시의 마지막 구절에 꼭 감사하다는 말을 넣을게요.","source_cn":"耶！感谢支持，我会在诗句的最后鸣谢你的贡献。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAB2837F2285A2D7D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"야호! 정말 감사해요. 시의 마지막 구절에 꼭 감사하다는 말을 넣을게요.","female":"야호! 정말 감사해요. 시의 마지막 구절에 꼭 감사하다는 말을 넣을게요.","variant_male_record_index":"164445","variant_female_record_index":"164446","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421133010:1":{"text":"...진짜, 애교부리면 매번 다 들어준다고 생각하면 곤란해! 이번이 진짜 마지막이야!","source_cn":"……真是的，别以为一撒娇我们就会答应你！下不为例！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE59E975FF3BDCD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421133011:1":{"text":"사리에 님을 만나고 싶은 거지? 데려가 줄게.","source_cn":"不是要找沙利叶大人吗？我带你们过去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF59B5373881936A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"도와줄게","source_cn":"我帮你","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAE7C9A7287B0B76B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"도와줄게","female":"도와줄게","variant_male_record_index":"72832","variant_female_record_index":"72833","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421133009:1":{"text":"제발, 부탁해! 시레이, 넌 좋은 친구잖아!","source_cn":"拜托！求求你了，席蕾你人最好啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAA7973D3493BD35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"시레이가 도와줄 거야","source_cn":"让席蕾帮你","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x56E7